{"title":"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4d0a5269333b1bf17002379313a404c1467f675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1=F_2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0d4bb35d3c67af1de199490872e44b5d6d2b34d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_{n+2}=F_{n+1}+F_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/c/9ccd696a5d0cbab8337ceb8a4cdfa202a54a6eae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b302a9f52ba99762809e96394f34b85facc34489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=F_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate of the intersection between the linear equations\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1c5eaced8e780d68f9b79042ecf753c6b0c4fda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F_{2007} x + F_{2008} y = F_4,\\]\" width=\"167\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfca424ee8d7b1145b658f97f9d92548e019737d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F_{2008}x+F_{2009}y=-F_3.\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We subtract equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef4b9c1fd52d45d2d3049a8e87794c06757091d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_{2006}x+F_{2007}y=-F_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"176\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/9746865266d3bd7d63cbb51957bbe2b01fb8924f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_{2005}x+F_{2006}y=F_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"162\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>We can see the pattern:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2d5f412417176e02c2eed9deda0a5bb35d3e2fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_{n}x+F_{n+1}y=(-1)^{n-1}F_{2011-n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"244\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Thus\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/a/bca70347798dc09c38704b9ce2c9320289dc8cd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=F_{2010}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/6/ab624ee5b65918444f24b0fe27fa42464aed0d70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2y=-F_{2009}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/1/381f1032bbb73efde19661b2b1f577c3004abca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-F_{2011}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/91857c28ff2ea1fd252438352bf38e75c3bade74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=F_{\\boxed{2012}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"94\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST\">2007 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Alab